msgstr "ENTERED BY HAND, not inferred from whether a work order exists. Many stoppages need only a remote restart: a stoppage, no failure. Planned maintenance is the other way round. Infer this field wrongly and MTBF is wholly wrong — wrong in the flattering direction."

#. module: eam_work_order
